From 06bfa0533b8a424b112febedda03286c04fc6ddc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 14:16:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] logging: structure socket and SOCKS connection failure
 diagnostics

Reuse typed remote endpoint/error fields for eight remaining direct Info
producers and the matching automatic-connection Debug branch. Keep existing
Info versus NET/Debug, readable text, helper preformatting, all socket calls,
timeouts, return paths and platform guards. Snapshot numeric socket last-error
before the event builder; keep its string rendering inside the logging guard.
No new public fields or network behavior changes.

Add actual ConnectDirectly regressions with a scoped scripted Sock factory:
wait failure, SO_ERROR failure, manual/automatic connect failures and unsupported
address. No OS traffic is performed by those controls. A separate focused
node fixture requests one owned loopback connection that is deliberately refused.
SO_NOSIGPIPE/nonblocking/SOCKS handshake failure paths are not newly forced.

Scripted diff (ast-grep-py 0.51.0):
  /private/tmp/lane-n4-build/logging-compose/ast-venv/bin/python contrib/logging/conversion/convert.py --rules contrib/logging/conversion/rules/network-socket-failure-diagnostics.json --report /Users/shammah/repos/lotus-v2-repair-work/logging-cleanup/netbase285-conversion.json --apply
  git clang-format --force --binary /opt/homebrew/bin/clang-format --style '{BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig, BreakStringLiterals: false}' HEAD -- src/netbase.cpp src/test/logging_event_tests.cpp

Tests are source-only pending a bounded native gate at this commit. Shared
eCash owner, not a Lotus consensus feature. Preserve native276 seal separately.

